{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit"]]},"kind":"article","topicSections":[{"title":"Views","anchor":"Views","identifiers":["doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardViewItem","doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardViewStyle","doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardViewDragGestureOverlay","doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardViewDragGestureOverlayStyle"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"This article describes the native-looking ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and how to use it.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"KeyboardKit has a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that mimics the native iOS keyboard. It supports "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType"},{"type":"text","text":"s like "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/alphabetic"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/numeric"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/symbolic"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/emojis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/numberPad"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/clipboard"},{"type":"text","text":", as well as any "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardLayout"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/InputType","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"KeyboardView-English-Callout","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"KeyboardView-Swedish-Theme","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" will set up most things, like gestures, styles, callouts, settings, etc. based on the current services and state. It will automatically observe all contexts and settings and can render all ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Foundation\/Locale\/keyboardKitSupported","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" locales.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" will by default take up as much space as it needs, and resize the keyboard extension accordingly. It will also honor settings like ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardSettings\/isAutoCollapseKeyboardEnabled","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardSettings\/keyboardDockEdge","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardContext\/isKeyboardFloating","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"👑 KeyboardKit Pro can unlocks support for all supported locales and inject an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard","type":"reference"},{"text":" view into the keyboard view.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Customization","level":2,"anchor":"Customization","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can be customized in many ways, for instance by mutating the various contexts and settings, by injecting custom layouts and views, and by applying various view modifiers to modify behavior and styling.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Action Behavior","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The easiest way to customize the keyboard behavior is to inherit ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/StandardKeyboardActionHandler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and customize the behavior of any gesture on any action.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Actions-Article","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Callouts","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The easiest way to customize the secondary callout actions is to apply a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardCalloutActions(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" modifier to the view and customize the standard actions that are provided as view builder parameters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Callouts-Article","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Layout","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The easiest way to customize the keyboard layout is to inject a custom layout in the initializer. You can use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardLayout\/standard(for:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to get a standard layout for the current context, then modify it as needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Layout-Article","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Styling","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can customize the styling of the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and its nested views by applying any of the many style-based view modifiers, like ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardViewStyle(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardButtonStyle(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"tex